            "        |",
            "        v",
            "  [7] Implementation: actor and message",
            "        |",
            "        v",
            "  [8] Residual risk: monitor and review",
            "        |",
            "        v",
            "VERDICT -> A case answer is a complete decision process, not a moral reaction.",
            "ANSWER USE -> Use as the universal opening architecture."
